{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/TPS_SWCT_01295","versions":[{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/TPS_SWCT_01295@rel:R19-11#740fb1ac","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/TPS_SWCT_01295","release":"R19-11","content":"SwRecordLayout The SwRecordLayout describes how data is serialized in the memory of an ECU. This information is important with respect to the following aspects: • to inform a measurement and calibration system how the data is serialized in the memory of an ECU • to make sure that the software development results in the intended data struc- tures • to identify the proper interpolation routines Via the SwDataDefProps a record-layout can be associated to a data entity. If the very same serialization approach is used for multiple ApplicationDataType s all of 435 of 1124  AUTOSAR CONFIDENTIAL  Document ID 62: AUTOSAR_TPS_SoftwareComponentTemplate Software Component Template AUTOSAR CP R19-11 these may refer to the same SwRecordLayout even if the size of the data is different.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_TPS_SoftwareComponentTemplate.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-01T10:12:25+00:00"},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/TPS_SWCT_01295@rel:R20-11#24a047af","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/TPS_SWCT_01295","release":"R20-11","content":"SwRecordLayout The SwRecordLayout describes how data is serialized in the memory of an ECU. This information is important with respect to the following aspects: • to inform a measurement and calibration system how the data is serialized in the memory of an ECU • to make sure that the software development results in the intended data struc- tures • to identify the proper interpolation routines Via the SwDataDefProps a record-layout can be associated to a data entity. If the very same serialization approach is used for multiple ApplicationDataType s all of these may refer to the same SwRecordLayout even if the size of the data is different.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","so